Subject: [PATCH 6.3 098/246] net: bcmgenet: Remove phy_stop() from bcmgenet_netif_stop()
Date: Mon, 15 May 2023 18:25:10 +0200
Message-Id: <20230515161725.525914189@linuxfoundation.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.40.1
